Article 2 (Application for Authorization to Establish a Technical College Corporation)
(1) A person intending to establish a technical college corporation shall submit to the Minister of Education an application for authorization of establishment and the required documents under Article 4 of the Decree no later than eight months before the scheduled opening date. <Amended on February 2, 1999; March 4, 2008; March 23, 2013>
(2) A technical college establishment plan under subparagraph 4 of Article 4 of the Decree shall include:
1. Courses, name, location, departments, student quotas, and scheduled opening date of the technical college;
2. Plan for construction or securing of school buildings;
3. Plan for securing faculty members;
4. Financial operation plan of the technical college.
